{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Fly Mind 是一款主打極簡介面的心智圖工具，適合需要快速整理思緒、規劃專案或記錄會議重點的讀者。操作直覺，數步即可完成美觀的心智圖，讓想法一目瞭然。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，此免費版本包含廣告。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-126.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>無限畫布自由整理思緒</h2>\n<p>App 內建 56 種主題與 9 種線條樣式，可自由改變線條風格，配搭簡潔介面與可摺疊選單，整理思緒更順手。畫布可無限擴展，中心想法同樣無限延伸，任何節點都能自由移動，線條會自動調整。完成後可將作品儲存為相片；清單以大型截圖呈現，方便一眼看清所有心智圖。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1242\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2208x1242bb.jpg\" width=\"2208\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1242\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2208x1242bb-1.jpg\" width=\"2208\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1242\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2208x1242bb-2.jpg\" width=\"2208\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1242\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2208x1242bb-3.jpg\" width=\"2208\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1242\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2208x1242bb-4.jpg\" width=\"2208\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Fly Mind Free-Clear Mind Map</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/fly-mind-free-clear-mind-map/id1134527972?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:41:47.080456+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:37:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:18:33.598830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:38:33.082375+00:00","content_hash":"ab9ce941281e53b25a3eb34e97c2dbac2fcf584879aa97253208c8e1b6105dd3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}